---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'; import Breadcrumbs from '../../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro'; import LastVerified from '../../../components/LastVerified.astro'; import UpdateBadge from '../../../components/UpdateBadge.astro'; import QuickAnswer from '../../../components/QuickAnswer.astro'; import SourceList from '../../../components/SourceList.astro'; import AdsterraNativeBanner from '../../../components/AdsterraNativeBanner.astro'; import { sourceUrls, patch107 } from '../../../data/sources';
const title='DragonSword Awakening Runes — Capacity, Synthesis & Build Relevance'; const description='DragonSword Awakening Runes guide covering inventory capacity, ownership display, 4-Star synthesis, possible 5-Star results and what remains unverified.'; const canonical='https://dragonswordguide.com/systems/runes/'; const article={ '@context':'https://schema.org','@type':'Article',headline:title,description,mainEntityOfPage:canonical,datePublished:'2026-08-08',dateModified:'2026-08-11',publisher:{'@type':'Organization',name:'DragonSword Guide'} }; const sources=[{label:'Official 1.0.7 update notes',href:sourceUrls.announcements,note:'Evidence B — supports capacity 200 → 500, owned-count display and 4-Star synthesis yielding 5-Star Runes.'}];
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical} ogType="article" schema={[article]}><div class="shell page-wrap"><Breadcrumbs items={[{label:'DragonSword Guide',href:'/'},{label:'Systems',href:'/systems/runes/'},{label:'Runes'}]}/><article><header class="article-header"><p class="eyebrow">Systems · Rune inventory</p><h1>DragonSword Awakening Runes</h1><LastVerified date="August 11, 2026"/></header><QuickAnswer title="The official 1.0.7 note gives us the inventory facts."><p>Rune inventory capacity increased from 200 to 500, owned Rune counts are now shown, and 4-Star Rune Synthesis can yield 5-Star Runes. Drop rates, stat ceilings and optimal farming routes are not verified here.</p></QuickAnswer><UpdateBadge label={`${patch107.label} · Rune changes`} href={patch107.href}/><div class="copy"><h2>What are Runes?</h2><p>Runes are part of the build conversation: they are a resource layer to consider alongside a Hero's role, combat behavior and the team sequence around that Hero. The public update notes confirm system changes, but do not publish a complete Rune stat or ranking guide.</p><h2>What changed in Rune inventory?</h2><div class="metrics"><div><strong>500</strong><span>Current stated capacity</span></div><div><strong>200 → 500</strong><span>1.0.7 capacity change</span></div><div><strong>Owned count</strong><span>Rune totals now display</span></div></div><p>Update 1.0.7 expanded maximum Rune inventory capacity from 200 to 500 and improved the inventory to display the number of Runes owned.</p><h2>How does Rune synthesis work?</h2><p>The official note confirms that 4-Star Rune Synthesis can now yield 5-Star Runes. That answers the narrow question “Can 4-Star Runes become 5-Star Runes?” with <strong>yes, as a possible result</strong>; it does not establish a guaranteed outcome.</p><h2>Runes and builds</h2><p>Use Runes as one part of a build framework, not as a standalone ranking. Start with the Hero role and the Status → Signal flow you can actually execute, then treat Rune choices as a resource question to verify in-game. Compare that single-Hero layer with the broader <a href="/builds/">build framework</a>, <a href="/characters/">character reference</a> and <a href="/teams/">team-composition guide</a>.</p><AdsterraNativeBanner/><h2>What is not verified yet?</h2><p class="evidence-note"><strong>NOT_YET_VERIFIED:</strong> best Rune or set, exact drop rates, stat ceilings, guaranteed synthesis outcomes, optimal farming locations and farming routes. The official update note does not provide those details, and community recommendations are not primary balance evidence.</p><h2>Rune FAQ</h2><h3>Can 4-Star Runes become 5-Star Runes?</h3><p>Yes. The official 1.0.7 note says 4-Star Rune Synthesis can now yield 5-Star Runes; “can yield” does not mean every synthesis is guaranteed to produce one.</p><h3>What is the Rune inventory capacity?</h3><p>The stated maximum increased from 200 to 500 in update 1.0.7.</p><h3>Is there a best Rune?</h3><p>NOT_YET_VERIFIED. This site does not publish a best Rune or drop-rate claim without verified in-game data.</p></div><SourceList sources={sources}/></article></div></BaseLayout>
<style>.page-wrap{padding:1.25rem 0 2rem}.article-header{max-width:820px;margin-bottom:1.5rem}.eyebrow{color:var(--accent-light);font-size:.72rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase}h1,h2{line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-.04em}h1{font-size:clamp(2.4rem,7vw,5rem);margin:0 0 .7rem}h2{font-size:clamp(1.45rem,3vw,2rem);margin:2.5rem 0 .7rem}.copy{max-width:760px}.copy p{color:var(--muted-strong)}.metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:.7rem}.metrics div{display:grid;gap:.2rem;padding:1rem;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--paper);border-radius:10px}.metrics strong{color:var(--accent-light);font-size:1.3rem}.metrics span{color:var(--muted);font-size:.76rem}@media(max-width:650px){.metrics{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style>
